NeuTTS architecture attribution
================================

The VoiceHub-owned NeuTTS graph follows the Neuphonic NeuTTS implementation
at revision ac69851f28fc63a487917e7c2e27f0d75c759cba. NeuTTS code and applicable
model releases use the NeuTTS Open License v1.0. The complete license text is
distributed at:

    voicehub/models/neutts/source/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSE

That license permits research and limited commercial use and requires a
separate paid license for commercial use by legal entities whose annual
revenue reaches its USD 5,000,000 threshold. Consult the complete license
before use or redistribution.

The native NeuCodec graph follows:

* neuphonic/neucodec at revision
  ed3e6cd1bdc374ce14a21355e5eee66a777149ce; and
* the Hugging Face Transformers NeuCodec reference at revision
  91d0737eea53da41c98b45da1cd8116e518aad21.

Those NeuCodec implementation sources and the official NeuCodec checkpoint
are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Exact checkpoint revisions, hashes, tensor counts, and source boundaries are
recorded in SOURCE.json and metadata.py.
